# onnxruntime-node (via @huggingface/transformers, for @stackone/defender)
# runs on the CPU here: the bridge never asks for a GPU device, and GitHub's
# runners have none. Its installer would otherwise download several hundred MB
# of CUDA libraries from NuGet on every install, which nothing loads and which
# timed out once (tennisnews run 45010970080).
onnxruntime-node-install=skip
